{
  "name": "Forteresse - Surveillance SecOps",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Surveillance Forteresse\n\n1. REMPLACER l'URL dans les 2 noeuds HTTP (tunnel cloudflared ou VM)\n2. Configurer le credential SMTP dans le noeud Email\n3. Renseigner le mot de passe n8n-bot (variable d'env N8N_PASSWORD ou mot de passe)\n4. Activer le workflow\n\nLogic testee par scripts/n8n-simulation.js",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Note - Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-560, -200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Toutes les 5 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-160, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:3000/api/login",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"username\": \"n8n-bot\", \"password\": \"{{$env.FORTERESSE_API_PASSWORD}}\"}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Login API (JWT)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [40, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://host.docker.internal:3000/api/audit?limit=100",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Lire audit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [240, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Meme logique que scripts/n8n-simulation.js (fonction analyser)\nconst reponse = $input.first().json;\nconst evenements = reponse.evenements || [];\n\nconst CRITIQUES = new Set([\n  'RATE_LIMIT_BLOCAGE',\n  'PRIVILEGE_ESCALATION_BLOCKED',\n  'API_ACCESS_DENIED',\n]);\n\nconst alertes = [];\nfor (const e of evenements) {\n  if (CRITIQUES.has(e.action)) {\n    alertes.push({ type: e.action, severite: e.level, qui: e.username, details: e.details });\n  } else if (\n    e.action === 'USER_CREATED' &&\n    e.details &&\n    ['admin', 'superadmin'].includes(e.details.nouveauRole)\n  ) {\n    alertes.push({ type: 'NOUVEL_ADMINISTRATEUR', severite: 'notice', qui: e.username, details: e.details });\n  } else if (\n    e.action === 'ROLE_CHANGED' &&\n    e.details &&\n    ['admin', 'superadmin'].includes(e.details.nouveauRole)\n  ) {\n    alertes.push({ type: 'ELEVATION_PRIVILEGE', severite: 'notice', qui: e.username, details: e.details });\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { alertes, totalAnalyses: evenements.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Detecter les alertes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-alertes",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.alertes.length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Des alertes ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [640, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "secops@forteresse.local",
        "toEmail": "equipe-secops@exemple.fr",
        "subject": "=🛡️ [Forteresse] {{ $json.alertes.length }} alerte(s) sécurité",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:640px;\"><div style=\"background:#1e3a5f;color:#ffffff;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;\">🛡️ Alerte SecOps — Forteresse</h2><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;\">{{ $json.alertes.length }} événement(s) détecté(s) par la surveillance automatique</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f1f5f9;\"><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Sévérité</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Événement</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Acteur</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">Détails</th></tr>{{ $json.alertes.map(a => { const sev = String(a.severite || 'info'); const col = {critical:'#dc2626',warning:'#ea580c',notice:'#2563eb'}[sev] || '#64748b'; const esc = (s) => String(s === undefined || s === null ? '—' : s).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;'); return '<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:' + col + ';font-weight:bold;\">' + esc(sev.toUpperCase()) + '</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">' + esc(a.type) + '</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;\">' + esc(a.qui) + '</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;\">' + esc(JSON.stringify(a.details)) + '</td></tr>'; }).join('') }}</table><p style=\"color:#888888;font-size:11px;\">Généré automatiquement par le workflow « Surveillance SecOps » — journal d'audit Forteresse. Ne pas répondre.</p></div>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Envoyer l'alerte",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
